    [scope_too_narrow] context-not-reported-unread/context-subheading-ends-section
      Every heading, whatever its level, resets `section` to its own text. A subheading inside Context (for example `### Measurements`) sets `section` to a name that is not in `_CONTEXT`. Later blocks under it then fall to the paragraph or other branches and land in `unclaimed`, which is what the report reads as unread source.
