    [missing_case] context-not-reported-unread/context-heading-match-exact-only
      The Context section is recognised only when the lowercased, stripped heading text equals exactly `context`. Variants such as `Context:` or `Background / Context`, or a Context heading written with emphasis markup, do not match. Their blocks fall into `unclaimed` and are reported as unread.
